cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TeNeT: Tensor Network Thermodynamics"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article under preferred-citation."
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/IakOBiaN/tenet"
abstract: >-
  Tensor network renormalization for the statistical mechanics of lattice models.
  Computes the grand potential per site through several renormalization-group
  schemes (TRG, BTRG, HOTRG, transfer matrix, hierarchical lattices) and derives
  thermodynamic observables from it. The main application is adsorption of
  molecules on surfaces.
keywords:
  - tensor networks
  - renormalization group
  - lattice models
  - statistical mechanics
  - adsorption
authors:
